        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a <strong><i>difficult</i></strong> 3D maze game. You can move not only left and right, but also up and down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful of your direction when looking up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the maze, complete the map, and earn rewards based on your progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful of your direction when looking down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is only one ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to the game, you can also enjoy music unlocked by completing secret conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can access it from the jukebox menu on the title screen. </p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a <strong><i>difficult</i></strong> 3D maze game. You can move not only left and right, but also up and down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful of your direction when looking up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the maze, complete the map, and earn rewards based on your progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful of your direction when looking down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is only one ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to the game, you can also enjoy music unlocked by completing secret conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can access it from the jukebox menu on the title screen. </p>",
